  },
  "4032481": {
    "desc": "It's missing some holes, as though it were constructed hastily. But the sound seems to be fine.",
    "name": "Unseemly Ocarina",
  },
  "4032482": {
    "desc": "You must live life with passion, so that the rest of the world might learn how to live.\\r\\n#c- Dark Lord -#",
